### 1. Register a New User Account
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test1@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

###

### 2. Log In to Get a JWT Authorization Token
# @name loginRequest
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otiecollins131@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

###

### 3. Capture the Token dynamically from the login request
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}

###

### 4. Create a User Note (Requires valid Auth Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "verseReference": "GEN 1:1",
  "content": "In the beginning, God created the heavens and the earth. This shows absolute sovereignty."
}

###

### 5. Fetch Saved Notes (Requires valid Auth Token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

